## Chapter 2: The Dispensary (100svh, 3D medicine-box shelf)

Everything is positioned from the section centre using --H, so it looks the same at any desktop size.

### Heading and tabs
- Top-left (32px, 110px): boxed label "THE DISPENSARY / दवाखाना".
- Five boxed .lbl tabs centred, top at 50% - H/2 - 86px: ALL / सभी, BODY, SKIN & HAIR, WOMEN, MIND. Each 23px tall, 0 11px padding, margin-left -1px so borders merge.
- Indicator: a herb-green block behind the tabs, 23px tall. Its width and translateX are set to the active tab's offsetWidth and offsetLeft and transition over .6s var(--ease). Active text turns white over .45s. The active tab is always the category of the active box. ALL is never highlighted.

### The stage
- Section: full width, top at 50% - H/2 - 40px, height H + 80px, perspective 2200px, perspective-origin 50% 50%, touch-action pan-y.
- A zero-size .stage at left 50%, top 50%, transform-style preserve-3d, holding every box.
- Measure H by inserting an off-screen probe with height var(--H). Then: ws = H*142/840 (spine width), d = H*474/900 (cover width = box depth), gap = H*0.03. Write ws and d to the stage as --ws and --d.
- Each .box3d is a zero-size preserve-3d element with will-change transform and two faces, each H tall, top at -H/2, backface-visibility hidden, 2px radius:
  - Spine face .sp: width --ws, left -ws/2, transform translateZ(d/2).
  - Cover face .cv: width --d, left -d/2, transform rotateY(90deg) translateZ(ws/2), box-shadow 0 30px 60px -28px rgba(16,22,12,.55).
  - Each face has an ::after black overlay whose opacity comes from --shade. Spine shade = o*.55, cover shade = (1 - o)*.5.
- Endless shelf: render the 8 boxes three times (24 boxes), virtual index v = copy*8 + i. Relative index r = ((v - s) mod 24) brought into -12..+12. Skip any box whose x is more than W/2 + 1.5d from centre (visibility hidden).

### Placement and turning
- x = F(r) = r*(ws + gap) + (d - ws + 1.6*gap)*B(r), where B(r) = (r + sin(pi*r)/pi)/2 for |r| < 1, else +-0.5.
- Openness o = smoothstep(max(0, 1 - |r|)), smoothstep(x) = x*x*(3 - 2x).
- Transform order: translate3d(x, y, z) rotateZ() rotateX() rotateY(), where
  - rotateY = -90deg*o + tiltY*o
  - rotateX = tiltX*o
  - rotateZ = -4.5deg*o
  - z = o*0.2*H
  - y = -o*0.025*H - lift*0.045*H
- z-index = round(100 - |r|*4).
- Hover lift: hovering any box with |r| > .5 sets its lift target to 1, easing at 1 - e^(-12*dt). A hovered spine rises like a finger pulling it halfway out.
- Tilt toward the cursor: when the cursor is within 0.55d horizontally of the centre and 0.55H vertically of the shelf centre, the page is not in detail view and |T - s| < .3: tiltY targets (mx - W/2)/(0.55d)*9deg and tiltX targets -(my - cy)/(H/2)*6deg. Elsewhere tiltY drifts to (mx - W/2)/W*5deg and tiltX to 0. Smooth both at 1 - e^(-7*dt).

### Play ring
A fixed 42px circle, 1px herb border, herb colour, fill rgba(242,237,223,.75), 12px play triangle nudged 2px right. Centred on the open cover's lower-left corner: left = W/2 - 0.5d - 6px, top = shelf centre + 0.36H. Scale = smoothstep(max(0, 1 - |T - s|*3)). Click opens the detail.

