### Open sequence
1. Snap T to an integer, fill the texts, point the poster at the cover crop, reset blob radii to 0, read the cover face's screen rect (getBoundingClientRect).
2. The sheet grows out of the cover: set transform-origin to the cover's centre and animate over 1050ms, cubic-bezier(.76,0,.18,1), fill both, from clip-path inset(top right bottom left round 3px) with rotate(-4.5deg) to inset(0 round 0) with rotate(0).
3. Text lines slide from translateY(110%) to 0 over 900ms var(--ease), delay 620ms + index*75ms.
4. At 520ms a rAF loop grows each blob radius from 0 to 720 over 1250ms after its own delay, ease-out cubic 1 - (1-p)^3, stopping at 2.4s.
5. Play ring scales to 0. Cursor drops OPEN and spine states.
Close (button or Escape): the sheet animates back to the cover rect with rotate(-4.5deg) over 850ms, then hides and cancels animations.

