## Custom cursor (fine pointers only)
58 x 58px, fixed, centred on the pointer (-29px margins), z-index 100. Parts: a 1.5px ink ring, a 6px ink dot, and a hidden label "OPEN / खोलें" in Inter Tight 600 10px, white, centred. Follows the mouse at 1 - e^(-16*dt).

| State | When | Ring | Dot | Label |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| default | elsewhere | scale 1 | 1 | hidden |
| .spine | over a non-open box | .72 | 1 | hidden |
| .btn | over any button or link | .55 | 0 | hidden |
| .open | over the open cover | 1.75, herb fill and border | 0 | scale 1 |
| .drag | over the hero carousel | 1.4, ink border | 0 | label "DRAG" |

Ring transform, background and border transition over .5s / .4s / .4s var(--ease).

## Motion engine (Dispensary and global)
- State: s (current scroll position in box units), T (target), hover index, active, mx, my, cx, cy, tiltX, tiltY, onCover, isOpen.
- Each frame: dt clamped to 50ms. s += (T - s)*(1 - e^(-k*dt)), k = 5.2 (18 while dragging); snap when within 1e-4. Normalise s and T by whole loops past +-4 loops. Active = round(s) mod 8; when it changes, run the caption swap with dir = sign(T - s), update the tab indicator.
- Click a box: if |r| < .5 open the detail, else T = round(T + r). Arrows and Left/Right keys move T by one. Enter opens the detail, Escape closes it. Tabs jump to the first box of that category by the shortest way round the loop; ALL goes to box 0.
- Wheel inside the shelf only while it is in view: T += delta/(ws + gap)*0.5, then after 160ms of no wheel snap T to an integer. Ignore it while the detail is open. Do not block page scroll when the pointer is outside the shelf.
- Drag: pointerdown records x and T. After 5px it becomes a drag: T = T0 - dx/(ws + gap). pointerup snaps to an integer. A drag suppresses the click on the box it ended over.
- Open the page with box 0 centred.

