With prefers-reduced-motion: reduce: scroll spring and hover lift become instant (k = 1); caption swaps replace text without sliding; sheet open, close and text rises run in 1ms; the ink starts 5s in the past so the poster is fully visible; no carousel auto-scroll, no marquee, no videos, no tilt; the Journey stacks as a normal list.

